WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.292
Carabas ran over to Puss.

2
00:00:05.293 --> 00:00:07.704
"What are you doing?

3
00:00:07.705 --> 00:00:11.222
We don't live in this castle!"

4
00:00:11.223 --> 00:00:14.709
"Shh!" Puss said.

5
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:19.055
"Just pretend that we do."

6
00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:21.540
Carabas frowned.

7
00:00:21.541 --> 00:00:31.393
"Lying is wrong, Puss."

8
00:00:31.394 --> 00:00:36.176
The king and Fiona walked over.

9
00:00:36.177 --> 00:00:41.485
"This is a fine castle, Duke," the king said.

10
00:00:41.486 --> 00:00:46.063
"Actually . . . ," Carabas said.

11
00:00:46.064 --> 00:00:50.911
"Welcome home, Duke!" several voices called.

12
00:00:50.912 --> 00:00:54.053
Servants stood in the doorway.

13
00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.924
"Come inside," one said.

14
00:00:56.925 --> 00:00:59.894
"Lunch will be ready soon!"

15
00:00:59.895 --> 00:01:02.855
The king's eyes lit up.

16
00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:05.785
"What a nice surprise!

17
00:01:05.786 --> 00:01:13.842
I am rather hungry."

18
00:01:13.843 --> 00:01:21.454
Everyone went in.

19
00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:25.199
The king admired the servants.

20
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.993
"Everybody looks neat and tidy," he said.

21
00:01:29.994 --> 00:01:39.072
"Let's go to the dining room," Puss said.

22
00:01:39.073 --> 00:01:48.094
Carabas started to walk.

23
00:01:48.095 --> 00:01:51.515
"Silly Duke!" Puss said.

24
00:01:51.516 --> 00:01:54.586
"The dining room is this way!"

25
00:01:54.587 --> 00:01:59.761
The king laughed. "This castle is so big, Duke.

26
00:01:59.762 --> 00:02:05.440
You forgot where the dining room is!"

27
00:02:05.441 --> 00:02:08.735
Puss led everyone down a hallway.

28
00:02:08.736 --> 00:02:12.653
Carabas and Fiona walked together.

29
00:02:12.654 --> 00:02:17.025
"You have a lovely home, Duke," Fiona said.

30
00:02:17.026 --> 00:02:22.072
"Oh, it's, um, just a house," Carabas said.

31
00:02:22.073 --> 00:02:27.894
Fiona smiled. "It's nice that you don't brag."

32
00:02:27.895 --> 00:02:30.850
The king whispered to Fiona.

33
00:02:30.851 --> 00:02:32.714
"You should marry the duke.

34
00:02:32.715 --> 00:02:35.726
You would be rich!"

35
00:02:35.727 --> 00:02:40.053
"I don't care about money, Father," Fiona said.

36
00:02:40.054 --> 00:02:44.713
"I just want to marry a kind man."

